'''Good Jobs!''' (グッジョブ, ''Gujjobu'', '''Good Job''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

==Effect==
Study Power UP (Sm): XP gained after clearing a stage is increased by an additional 10%.

